# Shifting Grift, one mode at a time, each type of target only its own: the same board as the three-mode scenario. Turn 3, only
# "creatures" ({U}{U}{2}, the four Moxen): an artifact or an enchantment is no target, nor is one creature alone, nor
# the same creature twice; the Bears and the Elves are exchanged. Turn 5, only "artifacts" ({U}{U}{1}: the three mana the Sapphires and
# Jet make exactly): a creature or an enchantment is no target; the Ring and the Mox Pearl are exchanged. Turn 7, only "enchantments"
# ({U}{U}{1}): the Moon and the Crusade are exchanged. Each turn the earlier exchanges stand.

